WEBVTT


00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:29.971
<i>Are you OK?</i>


00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:34.472
<i>Yeah. God, I don't know
what's wrong with me.</i>


00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:39.780
I might just be coming down
with the flu, or something.


00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:48.256
Don't tell me
you're pregnant.


00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:51.126
I'm not pregnant.


00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:05.703
<i>No express service
between 34th and 14th Street.</i>


00:05:05.772 --> 00:05:08.263
<i>We apologize
for the inconvenience.</i>


00:06:43.836 --> 00:06:45.861
Parker!


00:06:45.938 --> 00:06:47.565
<i>Parker, no!</i>


00:07:13.633 --> 00:07:15.567
Hi, honey.


00:07:15.635 --> 00:07:18.763
<i>Hey, what are you
still doing up?</i>


00:07:18.838 --> 00:07:21.033
I've been waiting for you.


00:07:21.107 --> 00:07:22.199
<i>Ah.</i>


00:07:22.275 --> 00:07:27.042
You know,
I think your man
might make partner.


00:07:27.113 --> 00:07:31.413
What does your wife
get out of this partnership?


00:07:35.621 --> 00:07:36.610
Oh, wow.


00:07:36.689 --> 00:07:39.783
<i>God, you look beautiful.</i>


00:07:39.859 --> 00:07:42.453
More beautiful than usual?


00:07:45.832 --> 00:07:48.960
Maybe.
Maybe.


00:07:49.035 --> 00:07:51.230
I'm pregnant.


00:07:53.306 --> 00:07:55.536
Are you serious?


00:07:55.608 --> 00:07:57.075
I'm serious.


00:07:57.143 --> 00:07:58.132
Are you sure?


00:07:58.211 --> 00:08:03.547
I'm sure.
I have four pregnancy tests
that say I am.


00:08:03.616 --> 00:08:05.584
Oh my God.
I love you.


00:08:28.975 --> 00:08:32.172
I really think it's time
we consider moving
out of the city.


00:08:32.245 --> 00:08:35.476
You know?
Just like we always wanted.


00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.645
You mean
like you've always wanted.


00:08:40.586 --> 00:08:45.353
Wait, you said,
"I will never raise kids
in this city."


00:08:45.424 --> 00:08:52.159
I know. I know.
But, I feel different now
that I'm actually having one.


00:08:52.231 --> 00:08:55.564
Well anyway,
we should look
at a couple of places.


00:08:55.635 --> 00:09:01.733
Yeah? I've got the name
of a good real estate agent.


00:09:03.509 --> 00:09:05.067
Will you think about it?


00:09:05.144 --> 00:09:07.203
Maybe.
I'll think about it.


00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:08.269
OK.


00:09:14.086 --> 00:09:15.075
Ugh.


00:09:18.758 --> 00:09:21.318
Get out of here now!
Get out! Go! Leave!


00:09:34.307 --> 00:09:37.037
<i>I've saved this property
for last</i>


00:09:37.109 --> 00:09:40.044
<i>because I think
it's really special.</i>


00:09:40.112 --> 00:09:42.444
<i>Now, as you can see
it's very private</i>


00:09:42.515 --> 00:09:46.645
<i>but just as commutable
as the other homes
we've looked at.</i>


00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.613
<i>Wow.</i>


00:09:49.689 --> 00:09:51.884
<i>It's really big.</i>


00:09:51.958 --> 00:09:53.721
<i>It's spacious</i>


00:09:53.793 --> 00:09:56.455
<i>but don't let that put you off
until you've seen it.</i>


00:10:03.336 --> 00:10:05.361
Wow.


00:10:05.438 --> 00:10:07.167
It's beautiful.


00:10:21.687 --> 00:10:24.520
<i>This home was built
with children in mind.</i>


00:10:26.759 --> 00:10:28.989
Do you plan
on having any children?


00:10:29.061 --> 00:10:31.586
Actually I'm pregnant
right now.


00:10:31.664 --> 00:10:33.894
That's wonderful.
Congratulations!


00:10:33.966 --> 00:10:36.059
Thank you.
Thank you.


00:10:36.135 --> 00:10:38.968
You have to admit
this would make
a perfect nursery.


00:10:39.038 --> 00:10:40.596
Yeah.


00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:50.578
<i>With this much land
so close to the city,</i>


00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:52.948
I'm sure it's out of our price range.
Isn't it?


00:10:53.019 --> 00:10:54.748
No. Actually the owners
are anxious


00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:57.118
to get the place off their hands
as soon as possible.


00:10:57.189 --> 00:10:58.178
Really?


00:10:58.257 --> 00:11:00.054
Their daughter
went off to college,


00:11:00.126 --> 00:11:02.060
so they decided to move
into the city.


00:11:02.128 --> 00:11:06.121
I guess they felt
like this was too much house
for the two of them.


00:11:39.031 --> 00:11:41.431
<i>Come on.
We spoke about it.</i>


00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:43.866
<i>Yeah, I know.
I know.</i>


00:11:47.373 --> 00:11:49.102
OK, it's finished.


00:11:49.175 --> 00:11:51.109
<i>Is it gonna work?</i>


00:11:51.177 --> 00:11:52.166
<i>Yeah.</i>


00:11:52.244 --> 00:11:53.233
Yeah?


00:11:53.312 --> 00:11:54.802
<i>Yeah.
Go see for yourself.</i>


00:12:35.121 --> 00:12:36.918
<i>Well?</i>


00:12:36.989 --> 00:12:39.287
<i>Does it work?</i>


00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:42.989
It works.


00:14:14.353 --> 00:14:16.719
Oh!
No, no!


00:14:16.789 --> 00:14:18.256
<i>What are you doing?</i>


00:14:18.324 --> 00:14:21.293
It's a mouse.
There's a mouse.


00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.759
It's a what?


00:14:22.828 --> 00:14:23.817
It's a mouse.


00:14:25.364 --> 00:14:26.353
<i>All right.</i>


00:14:33.105 --> 00:14:35.801
OK, I've got it.
Where is it?


00:14:35.875 --> 00:14:37.536
He went
under the dresser.


00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:38.736
Under here?


00:14:38.811 --> 00:14:39.903
<i>Yeah.</i>


00:14:39.979 --> 00:14:41.071
OK.


00:14:43.449 --> 00:14:44.746
<i>OK, mousy,
come on.</i>


00:14:44.817 --> 00:14:47.217
What are you doing
with that?


00:14:48.954 --> 00:14:50.945
<i>He's probably
next door by now.</i>


00:15:19.285 --> 00:15:20.809
Oan I write you
a check?


00:15:20.886 --> 00:15:22.877
Yeah.
Yeah, you can write me
a check.


00:15:22.955 --> 00:15:24.286
Oh, good.


00:15:33.032 --> 00:15:38.698
You moved
into Jenny's old house?
1620 Woodland Lane.


00:15:38.771 --> 00:15:42.104
Oh.
Yeah, I guess I did.


00:15:42.174 --> 00:15:48.306
That's Jenny's house.
She used to work here.
We were pretty decent friends.


00:15:51.483 --> 00:15:53.041
Thanks.


00:15:53.118 --> 00:15:54.585
Thank you very much.


00:17:08.027 --> 00:17:09.119
<i>Let me tell you,</i>


00:17:09.194 --> 00:17:11.856
<i>they didn't have
the drugs back then
that they do now.</i>


00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:13.192
<i>I'm sure.</i>


00:17:13.265 --> 00:17:16.462
<i>But Mom, I don't want
the drugs.</i>


00:17:16.535 --> 00:17:19.368
I'm planning on having
a natural birth.


00:17:19.438 --> 00:17:20.700
<i>You don't want
the drugs?</i>


00:17:20.773 --> 00:17:21.762
Nope.


00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:23.671
<i>What the hell
are you talking about?</i>


00:17:23.742 --> 00:17:26.040
<i>Are you crazy?
Who wouldn't want the drugs?</i>


00:17:26.111 --> 00:17:29.171
<i>Mom, you know
the drugs are actually
bad for the baby.</i>


00:17:29.248 --> 00:17:30.875
<i>They aren't bad
for the baby.</i>


00:17:30.949 --> 00:17:31.938
Yes, they are.


00:17:32.017 --> 00:17:34.679
<i>You'll be singing
a different tune
when the baby comes.</i>


00:17:34.753 --> 00:17:37.813
<i>Trust me.
Yoga and all that breathing
doesn't mean shit</i>


00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:41.121
<i>with a ten pound parasite
coming out
from between your legs.</i>


00:17:41.193 --> 00:17:45.630
<i>It's true.
Why do you think
you're an only child?</i>


00:17:45.697 --> 00:17:47.130
Mom, you're scaring me.


00:17:47.199 --> 00:17:49.895
<i>Well, you should be scared.
You should be horrified.</i>


00:17:49.968 --> 00:17:52.266
<i>I'd come but I don't even
want to be reminded.</i>


00:17:52.337 --> 00:17:55.636
Thanks for the support, Mom.
Could you just hold on
for one second?


00:17:55.707 --> 00:17:57.231
I want to put
Parker downstairs.


00:17:57.309 --> 00:17:59.174
He's been driving me
up the wall lately.


00:17:59.244 --> 00:18:00.233
<i>OK.</i>


00:18:00.312 --> 00:18:01.438
Come here.


00:18:01.513 --> 00:18:04.038
Oh God.


00:18:07.386 --> 00:18:09.183
There you go.


00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:15.654
Hi.


00:18:42.921 --> 00:18:44.047
<i>Mom, I need to go.</i>


00:18:44.123 --> 00:18:46.751
I'm actually cooking
dinner for Steven tonight.


00:18:46.825 --> 00:18:49.293
<i>Cook?
Did you move to a farm?</i>


00:18:49.361 --> 00:18:51.852
<i>What?
They don't have delivery
out there?</i>


00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:53.693
I like cooking.


00:18:53.765 --> 00:18:56.791
And Steven's been working
really hard lately


00:18:56.869 --> 00:18:59.337
and he comes home
like ten o'clock at night


00:18:59.404 --> 00:19:00.871
and I think
he'd like a meal.


00:19:00.939 --> 00:19:05.035
<i>Well, I hope he doesn't plan
on working these kind of hours
when the baby comes.</i>


00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:07.874
He's going to take some time
off when the baby comes.


00:19:07.946 --> 00:19:08.935
<i>OK.
Good.</i>


00:19:09.014 --> 00:19:10.709
It's great to talk to you.


00:19:10.782 --> 00:19:11.976
<i>You too, sweetie.</i>


00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:13.711
OK.
Take care
of yourself, OK?


00:19:13.785 --> 00:19:15.343
<i>You take care of yourself.
Bye.</i>


00:19:17.623 --> 00:19:19.921
Parker!
Come here, boy!


00:19:19.992 --> 00:19:21.755
Come on!
It's time to eat!


00:19:21.827 --> 00:19:24.125
Come here!
Come on!


00:19:25.697 --> 00:19:27.858
<i>Parker!</i>


00:19:30.602 --> 00:19:33.662
Parker.
How you doing?


00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.805
Oh God!


00:19:54.493 --> 00:19:57.894
No! Oh God!


00:20:07.539 --> 00:20:09.507
<i>I am so sorry.</i>


00:20:09.575 --> 00:20:12.669
I had a nightmare
of a phone call
just as I was leaving.


00:20:16.815 --> 00:20:18.407
You OK?


00:20:23.255 --> 00:20:25.621
I killed Parker.


00:20:27.726 --> 00:20:28.988
What?


00:20:29.061 --> 00:20:31.222
I'm sorry.


00:20:34.266 --> 00:20:35.858
How?


00:21:18.877 --> 00:21:21.846
<i>Does this mean
I'll be a horrible mother?</i>


00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:25.413
Laura... it wasn't your fault.


00:21:26.718 --> 00:21:29.653
It was an accident.


00:21:32.157 --> 00:21:35.456
Why didn't I close
the door to the laundry room?


00:21:35.527 --> 00:21:39.463
Why didn't I do that?


00:21:39.531 --> 00:21:41.897
Let's get some sleep, eh?


00:21:46.305 --> 00:21:48.068
I'm sorry.


00:21:49.641 --> 00:21:51.165
I know.


00:21:53.812 --> 00:21:54.801
I know.


00:22:48.400 --> 00:22:50.163
I'm sorry.


00:22:53.338 --> 00:22:55.306
I'm sorry.


00:24:34.773 --> 00:24:36.365
Oh!


00:24:42.647 --> 00:24:44.478
Oh no!


00:24:46.051 --> 00:24:47.518
Oh no!


00:26:22.180 --> 00:26:24.410
Is there something wrong?


00:26:24.482 --> 00:26:27.542
Don't worry.
Everything's gonna be
all right.


00:27:45.163 --> 00:27:48.860
She's fine.
Everything's fine.


00:27:48.933 --> 00:27:50.525
Laura.


00:27:52.237 --> 00:27:54.398
Actually, she's asleep
right now but, uhm,


00:27:54.472 --> 00:27:58.465
they're just gonna keep her
in for a few more days
because of the c-section.


00:27:58.543 --> 00:28:01.137
You OK?


00:28:01.212 --> 00:28:03.407
Yeah, I'm,
I'm a little tired.


00:28:03.481 --> 00:28:06.177
You'll be able to rest
as soon as you feed her.


00:28:06.251 --> 00:28:08.742
<i>We advise our mothers
who've had a c-section</i>


00:28:08.820 --> 00:28:10.913
to breastfeed on their sides


00:28:10.989 --> 00:28:15.517
because your abdominals
are going to be sore
for awhile.


00:28:28.006 --> 00:28:30.702
It takes some practice.
You can do it.


00:28:32.844 --> 00:28:34.368
I don't think
she wants it.


00:28:34.446 --> 00:28:37.711
No, oh, you've got to be really...


00:28:37.782 --> 00:28:40.046
careful to make sure
that her mouth
is on it.


00:28:40.118 --> 00:28:42.450
You don't want to starve
your baby to death,


00:28:42.520 --> 00:28:46.547
thinking she's feeding
when she's not.
I've seen it happen.


00:28:49.994 --> 00:28:51.689
Ah.
See?


00:28:51.763 --> 00:28:54.391
Now, from here on out


00:28:54.466 --> 00:28:56.991
everything's pretty
much downhill.


00:30:20.718 --> 00:30:22.151
There you go.


00:30:22.220 --> 00:30:24.085
Oh God.


00:30:50.849 --> 00:30:52.248
Hey.


00:30:52.317 --> 00:30:53.443
Hi.


00:30:53.518 --> 00:30:57.887
Hello.
Hello, little one.


00:30:57.956 --> 00:30:59.924
Hello, my little one.


00:31:01.759 --> 00:31:05.251
No.
Oh-oh-oh.


00:31:07.131 --> 00:31:08.723
How long you been up?


00:31:08.800 --> 00:31:11.360
Uh, I don't know.


00:31:11.436 --> 00:31:12.926
What time is it?


00:31:13.004 --> 00:31:15.529
It's about six thirty.


00:31:15.607 --> 00:31:19.236
I don't even think
I slept.


00:31:19.310 --> 00:31:21.335
I heard those mice again.


00:31:21.412 --> 00:31:25.405
Oh Jesus.
Look, I'll call the exterminator.


00:31:25.483 --> 00:31:28.111
<i>I'll make sure
someone gets out here
today. OK?</i>


00:31:28.186 --> 00:31:29.881
OK.


00:31:29.954 --> 00:31:31.922
OK.


00:31:31.990 --> 00:31:34.788
<i>I've got to go.</i>


00:31:36.094 --> 00:31:38.289
<i>I've got to go,
sweetheart.</i>


00:31:39.831 --> 00:31:42.391
Oh. Here we go.


00:31:42.467 --> 00:31:44.697
There we go.


00:31:44.769 --> 00:31:46.964
See you.


00:31:52.243 --> 00:31:54.177
When are you coming home?


00:31:54.245 --> 00:31:55.974
<i>I'll call.</i>


00:32:53.071 --> 00:32:55.801
<i>God!</i>


00:32:56.207 --> 00:32:58.402
<i>Is there something wrong?</i>


00:32:58.476 --> 00:33:01.468
<i>I assure you
it's perfectly normal.</i>


00:33:01.546 --> 00:33:02.979
<i>I, I,
it's just that...</i>


00:33:03.047 --> 00:33:06.175
<i>Just use the ointment
I prescribed
and you should be fine.</i>


00:33:06.250 --> 00:33:08.013
<i>Really.</i>


00:33:08.086 --> 00:33:10.577
<i>Now, if you'll excuse me,
I've really got to go.</i>


00:33:10.655 --> 00:33:12.145
OK, bye.


00:33:38.950 --> 00:33:40.884
<i>You got a rodent problem?</i>


00:33:43.021 --> 00:33:44.045
<i>Hello?</i>


00:33:44.122 --> 00:33:45.111
<i>Hi.</i>


00:33:45.189 --> 00:33:46.178
<i>Hi.</i>


00:33:46.257 --> 00:33:47.485
<i>Why'd you call
so early?</i>


00:33:47.558 --> 00:33:49.082
I didn't.


00:33:49.160 --> 00:33:51.424
<i>Yeah.
Like around four
I got your message.</i>


00:33:51.496 --> 00:33:53.896
Oh, oh.


00:33:53.965 --> 00:33:55.159
<i>Are you OK?</i>


00:33:55.233 --> 00:34:01.502
Mom, how did you feel
after you gave birth
to me?


00:34:01.572 --> 00:34:04.871
<i>How did I feel?
I felt like shit.</i>


00:34:04.942 --> 00:34:06.341
You did?


00:34:06.411 --> 00:34:10.074
<i>How else
are you supposed to feel
after you've just had a baby?</i>


00:34:10.148 --> 00:34:12.480
<i>So, what,
you've got the blues
or something?</i>


00:34:12.550 --> 00:34:14.381
It's like I have
so much anxiety.


00:34:14.452 --> 00:34:17.148
I'm just worried
about every little stupid thing.


00:34:17.221 --> 00:34:20.622
<i>Yeah well, don't worry.
It goes away.
You'll be fine.</i>


00:34:20.691 --> 00:34:21.783
It does?


00:34:21.859 --> 00:34:25.522
<i>It's one of those aspects
of having a baby
that people fail to mention.</i>


00:34:25.596 --> 00:34:28.156
<i>Hormones,
they're horrible.</i>


00:34:28.232 --> 00:34:31.258
It's weird.
I feel like I'm going crazy.


00:34:31.335 --> 00:34:33.530
<i>You're not going crazy.</i>


00:34:33.604 --> 00:34:35.936
Excuse me.
Basement?


00:34:36.007 --> 00:34:38.908
<i>There's only room
for one crazy person
in this family</i>


00:34:38.976 --> 00:34:41.035
<i>and I already
got the job.</i>


00:35:19.217 --> 00:35:21.811
<i>I promise you,
it'll get better soon.</i>


00:35:21.886 --> 00:35:24.946
<i>You just need to get
some sleep.
At least five hours.</i>


00:35:25.022 --> 00:35:26.512
How am I
supposed to do that?


00:35:26.591 --> 00:35:28.354
The baby eats
like every two hours.


00:35:38.503 --> 00:35:41.939
I'm not going to do that.
He has a really stressful job.
OK?


00:35:42.006 --> 00:35:44.770
He can't get up like ten times
in the middle of the night.


00:35:44.842 --> 00:35:47.504
<i>And you can?
You guys
should take turns.</i>


00:35:47.578 --> 00:35:51.014
<i>So he has a job.
He goes and does his job.
Then he comes home</i>


00:35:51.082 --> 00:35:53.642
<i>and he has another job.
He's the father.</i>


00:35:53.718 --> 00:35:56.949
<i>The mother isn't the only one
who's responsible
for the child.</i>


00:36:05.329 --> 00:36:07.957
Mom...
can I call you back?


00:36:08.032 --> 00:36:09.329
<i>OK.</i>


00:36:13.638 --> 00:36:14.900
I'm sorry.


00:36:14.972 --> 00:36:18.203
No problem.
I'm just glad
you were around.


00:36:21.045 --> 00:36:24.503
I laid some traps
even though
I didn't see any droppings.


00:36:24.582 --> 00:36:28.348
But you never know.
They say if you got one mouse
you got forty.


00:36:28.419 --> 00:36:32.549
Like I said,
mice like to run up and down
the pipes.


00:36:32.623 --> 00:36:35.990
So if I were you,
I wouldn't leave your diary
in the utility closet.


00:36:36.060 --> 00:36:37.891
M ice like to eat
that kind of stuff.


00:36:37.962 --> 00:36:39.486
What diary?


00:36:39.564 --> 00:36:42.590
I just assumed it was yours.
It looked kind of girlie.


00:36:42.667 --> 00:36:45.431
If you'll just sign there,
Ma'am.


00:36:45.503 --> 00:36:48.597
Thank you.
And you call me
if you hear anything else.


00:36:48.673 --> 00:36:49.662
OK, I will.


00:37:34.819 --> 00:37:39.882
<i>Oh God!</i>


00:37:39.957 --> 00:37:45.486
Help!
Help!


00:37:46.230 --> 00:37:49.688
Help!!
Help!!


00:37:55.306 --> 00:37:58.605
<i>What are you talking about?</i>


