and I just can't imagine
she'd harm a baby.


01:07:23.706 --> 01:07:26.732
Well, then why
did she have a knife
in the baby's room?


01:07:26.809 --> 01:07:29.505
I don't know.
We're going to go
and talk to her.


01:07:31.347 --> 01:07:32.336
Hey, how are you?


01:07:32.581 --> 01:07:33.570
Hi.


01:07:35.184 --> 01:07:36.674
Oigarettes?


01:07:38.521 --> 01:07:40.352
I'm sorry,
it's none of my business.


01:07:40.956 --> 01:07:43.015
Did you ever get in contact
with Jenny?


01:07:44.360 --> 01:07:46.920
You said she left something
at the house.


01:07:46.996 --> 01:07:49.294
So I was just wondering
how she was doing.


01:07:49.365 --> 01:07:51.833
I gotta call her.
I'm gonna call her tomorrow.


01:07:53.836 --> 01:07:56.031
Thanks.
Good to see you.
OK.


01:07:56.105 --> 01:07:57.868
Bye.


01:08:04.280 --> 01:08:07.306
<i>New York University
student directory.</i>


01:08:07.383 --> 01:08:09.283
I'm looking
for a Jenny Foster.


01:08:09.351 --> 01:08:11.342
Uh, she goes
to school there.


01:08:11.420 --> 01:08:13.183
<i>OK,
one moment please.</i>


01:08:21.063 --> 01:08:22.530
<i>I'm sorry,
we have no record</i>


01:08:22.598 --> 01:08:24.930
<i>of a Jennifer Foster
attending school here.</i>


01:08:27.670 --> 01:08:28.659
<i>Hello?</i>


01:08:30.573 --> 01:08:35.135
<i>The earth, the dirt,
the blackness inside.</i>


01:08:35.211 --> 01:08:37.839
<i>Nothing in this room
makes me feel welcome.</i>


01:08:37.913 --> 01:08:40.143
<i>How am I ever
going to tell them about this?</i>


01:08:40.216 --> 01:08:42.116
<i>I hear voices.
Desperate.</i>


01:08:42.184 --> 01:08:45.881
<i>Are they my voices
or someone else's?</i>


01:08:49.191 --> 01:08:53.924
<i>I feel so cold in here.</i>


01:09:08.644 --> 01:09:12.410
I'll be right back.
OK? I'll be right back.


01:12:41.657 --> 01:12:43.215
<i>Police.</i>


01:12:43.292 --> 01:12:44.953
Someone is breaking
into my house!


01:12:45.994 --> 01:12:47.689
Ah! Ah!


01:13:39.681 --> 01:13:41.273
I called the police!!


01:13:41.350 --> 01:13:43.875
They're gonna be here
any second!!


01:15:19.414 --> 01:15:20.608
Ahh!!


01:15:23.118 --> 01:15:25.211
I want my baby!!


01:16:07.763 --> 01:16:09.196
Ah!


01:16:13.001 --> 01:16:14.263
Ah!


01:16:42.364 --> 01:16:44.457
<i>I don't know
what she looked like.</i>


01:16:44.533 --> 01:16:46.501
What's going on?


01:16:46.568 --> 01:16:49.867
Your wife called
about an intruder.


01:16:50.839 --> 01:16:52.136
Someone tried to break in?


01:16:52.207 --> 01:16:53.196
Yes.


01:16:53.275 --> 01:16:54.572
Jesus.
What happened?


01:16:54.643 --> 01:16:56.474
There was a woman
and she was outside


01:16:56.545 --> 01:16:59.673
and then she came inside
and then she was coming upstairs
and...


01:16:59.748 --> 01:17:01.010
She was gonna take
the baby.


01:17:01.083 --> 01:17:02.072
Was it M rs. Kasperian?


01:17:02.150 --> 01:17:04.345
I don't think
it was M rs. Kasperian.


01:17:04.419 --> 01:17:06.546
You know
she threatened Laura
with a knife.


01:17:06.622 --> 01:17:08.613
No, she didn't threaten me
with a knife.


01:17:08.690 --> 01:17:09.679
You know
what I mean.


01:17:09.758 --> 01:17:11.589
We talked
to her earlier.


01:17:11.660 --> 01:17:12.991
You talked to her?


01:17:13.061 --> 01:17:16.224
You just talked to her?
You didn't arrest her?


01:17:16.298 --> 01:17:18.061
It wasn't
M rs. Kasperian.


01:17:18.133 --> 01:17:19.122
Are you sure?


01:17:19.201 --> 01:17:22.534
Yeah. No.
I mean, it wasn't


01:17:22.604 --> 01:17:24.572
it didn't look
like her but...


01:17:24.640 --> 01:17:26.767
<i>I don't know.
She looked
more like me then,</i>


01:17:26.842 --> 01:17:29.640
<i>I don't know.
I want to put
the baby to bed.</i>


01:17:33.215 --> 01:17:35.308
<i>Can I talk to you
for a second?</i>


01:17:35.384 --> 01:17:37.716
<i>Yeah.
Yeah, sure.</i>


01:17:37.786 --> 01:17:40.152
Look, I know
your wife's really upset.


01:17:40.222 --> 01:17:44.124
But I'm going to be honest
with you.
Her story doesn't add up.


01:17:44.192 --> 01:17:47.684
Maybe she's a little lonely
out here by herself


01:17:47.763 --> 01:17:51.130
and worked herself
up into a frenzy.
I've seen it before.


01:17:51.199 --> 01:17:54.999
Are you telling me you think
my wife called you
just to get some attention?


01:17:55.070 --> 01:17:56.970
<i>Are you
out of your mind?</i>


01:17:57.039 --> 01:18:00.406
<i>I'm just saying
that I don't see anything
that leads me to believe</i>


01:18:00.475 --> 01:18:04.070
<i>that anyone
other than your wife
was here.</i>


01:18:04.146 --> 01:18:06.341
<i>I talked
to Mrs. Kasperian.</i>


01:18:06.415 --> 01:18:10.044
<i>She said she found the knife
already in the baby's crib.</i>


01:18:10.118 --> 01:18:11.517
<i>And you believe that?</i>


01:18:11.586 --> 01:18:15.989
M r. Davis,
I don't know what to believe.
That's my point.


01:18:16.058 --> 01:18:18.492
<i>Well, gentlemen,
thanks for coming out.</i>


01:18:18.560 --> 01:18:19.891
<i>Now look,
I am not saying...</i>


01:18:19.961 --> 01:18:21.189
<i>Good night, gentlemen.</i>


01:18:26.301 --> 01:18:28.360
Oall us
if you need us.


01:18:54.563 --> 01:18:56.394
Are you OK?


01:18:56.465 --> 01:18:59.366
I don't know
what's going on.


01:18:59.434 --> 01:19:03.564
It's OK.
Everything's going to be
all right.


01:19:05.741 --> 01:19:08.232
But I... I saw her.


01:19:08.310 --> 01:19:09.538
I know.


01:19:09.611 --> 01:19:13.240
I believe you.
Let's get some sleep.


01:20:46.274 --> 01:20:48.208
Shhhh.


01:21:58.179 --> 01:22:02.878
Yeah, look,
I just need a few days.
OK?


01:22:02.951 --> 01:22:06.114
I mean,
Jake can take care of things.


01:22:06.187 --> 01:22:10.317
I mean, he can always call me
if he needs me, anyway.


01:22:10.392 --> 01:22:12.121
Yeah.


01:22:12.193 --> 01:22:14.753
Yeah, yeah.
I know. I know.


01:22:14.829 --> 01:22:18.060
Well, uh,
look, I'll deal
with that on Monday...


01:22:20.535 --> 01:22:21.593
Oh my God!


01:22:46.561 --> 01:22:50.258
Ah!


01:22:51.433 --> 01:22:53.094
Oh.


01:23:17.993 --> 01:23:21.554
Excuse me,
do you have
any books on curses?


01:23:21.629 --> 01:23:24.291
You mean
like witchcraft?


01:23:25.700 --> 01:23:26.724
Yeah.


01:23:29.537 --> 01:23:31.664
My personal favorite.


01:25:08.036 --> 01:25:10.197
Get off!
Get off!


01:25:10.271 --> 01:25:11.738
Get off!!


01:25:11.806 --> 01:25:14.104
<i>No! No!
Get off!</i>


01:25:20.982 --> 01:25:22.506
Laura!


01:25:36.598 --> 01:25:40.090
I gave her something
that will help her sleep.


01:25:40.168 --> 01:25:41.863
Well, what's wrong
with her?


01:25:41.936 --> 01:25:43.198
It's too early to tell.


01:25:43.271 --> 01:25:45.967
We're going to keep her here
and monitor her behavior.


01:25:46.040 --> 01:25:48.941
She may be suffering
from Postpartum Psychosis.


01:26:15.103 --> 01:26:17.867
<i>You're starting to look
like yourself again.</i>


01:26:17.972 --> 01:26:19.906
<i>The doctors say
it's time to come home.</i>


01:26:19.974 --> 01:26:21.305
<i>Where's the baby?</i>


01:26:21.376 --> 01:26:25.039
<i>She's fine.
Your mother's with her
right now.</i>


01:26:25.113 --> 01:26:26.307
I'm sorry.


01:26:26.381 --> 01:26:27.780
Don't say sorry.


01:26:27.849 --> 01:26:29.544
I'm sorry.
I didn't really mean...


01:26:29.617 --> 01:26:31.778
I didn't want to hurt her.


01:26:31.853 --> 01:26:34.981
I don't want to hear you
say "sorry" anymore.


01:26:35.056 --> 01:26:40.995
OK? It's over.
It happened.
It doesn't matter.


01:26:41.062 --> 01:26:42.427
You know?


01:26:42.497 --> 01:26:45.398
Yeah, I'm happy
you're here.


01:26:45.466 --> 01:26:47.093
Good.


01:26:47.168 --> 01:26:48.726
I miss you.


01:26:48.803 --> 01:26:51.033
I'm right here, sweetheart.
I'm right here.


01:26:51.940 --> 01:26:52.929
OK?


01:26:56.711 --> 01:26:58.679
We just got to get you better.


01:27:03.751 --> 01:27:05.514
Hi, Mom.


01:27:05.587 --> 01:27:07.145
Hi, sweetie.


01:27:11.893 --> 01:27:13.417
She's beautiful.


01:27:13.494 --> 01:27:15.928
Yes, she is,
isn't she?


01:27:17.098 --> 01:27:18.622
How are you feeling?


01:27:19.767 --> 01:27:21.701
I feel better.


01:27:21.769 --> 01:27:24.033
Thank you for coming.


01:27:25.373 --> 01:27:27.933
I didn't realize
how much I could use your help.


01:27:28.009 --> 01:27:29.977
Well, if you told me
how cute she was


01:27:30.044 --> 01:27:32.478
I would have been
on the first plane here.


01:27:34.816 --> 01:27:37.614
Well you know,
now that Steven
is taking a month off,


01:27:37.685 --> 01:27:40.210
and you're going to be here
for a while,


01:27:40.288 --> 01:27:43.985
I thought maybe
I would start dancing again.


01:27:44.058 --> 01:27:45.753
Well, that's a great idea.


01:27:50.498 --> 01:27:53.023
That's a girl.


01:28:16.591 --> 01:28:19.389
It's great to see you
dancing again.


01:28:24.265 --> 01:28:26.426
You look beautiful.


01:33:07.081 --> 01:33:08.912
<i>Where's the baby?</i>


01:33:08.983 --> 01:33:11.508
Uh, I think
she's still sleeping.


01:33:11.586 --> 01:33:13.349
Hm.


01:33:13.421 --> 01:33:14.786
I'll go check on her.


01:33:14.855 --> 01:33:16.322
Hm.


01:33:45.486 --> 01:33:47.351
Good morning, sweetheart.


01:33:47.421 --> 01:33:48.888
Good morning.


01:33:51.659 --> 01:33:53.388
Where's Jessica?


01:34:01.202 --> 01:34:02.897
Who's Jessica?


01:34:08.542 --> 01:34:10.305
Laura, where's the baby?


01:34:14.415 --> 01:34:16.144
What baby?


01:34:22.356 --> 01:34:24.221
<i>Jessica!</i>


01:34:25.893 --> 01:34:27.656
<i>Jessica!!</i>


01:34:30.631 --> 01:34:32.258
<i>Jessica!!!</i>

